    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"an unburdened rest\"... that sounds almost beautiful, but it also sounds so permanent. like you're saying the only way to actually find peace from this emptiness is to just let everything go completely. is that what you mean? that there's no other way to truly stop the noise?",
